#: scenario6:scenario6_610A1B58_438B_4014_9854_20954784BA90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b01eccab43c950fcc3ef474706b233f3ed1af16591f47e04c86746a8b544498b
